          "contents": "# PDF\n\nRead text and tables out of PDFs, split or merge files, and fill form fields. Prefer extracting text over rendering pages to images: rendering is slower and loses selectability. When a table crosses a page break, paste the two fragments back together before quoting numbers.\n"
